                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b5c5e3f3-5ae3-3834-8a98-67131af200dc",
                        "entry_id": "e865784f-85e5-3444-aa25-e809596377f2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ремесленник, изготовляющий колёса."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "260d4981-1300-4ce1-b1d8-1ba9596225a2",
                                "sense_id": "b5c5e3f3-5ae3-3834-8a98-67131af200dc",
                                "text": "Кажется, понятно различие между санником и колесником: так вот, и думается, что санник ни за что не натягнет обода на спицы, а колеснику и вовек не умудриться накрутить вязок, уравнять полоз и тому подобное, а спросите-ка иного краснобая, что такое санник и что колесник?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7ac54373-c1f8-44ab-81a6-195634a66c3f",
                        "source_entry_id": "e865784f-85e5-3444-aa25-e809596377f2",
                        "source_sense_id": "b5c5e3f3-5ae3-3834-8a98-67131af200dc",
                        "target_lang_word": "wheelwright",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wheelwright",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb9db454-49e5-34e1-98c1-79cef690ac71",
                                        "entry_id": "85f1131b-ab5e-34c1-aa08-05d724fac7c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who builds and repairs wheels, especially wooden spoked ones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "447b9833-0e92-414d-ae8c-fa1233618ade",
                                                "sense_id": "eb9db454-49e5-34e1-98c1-79cef690ac71",
                                                "text": "Near-synonym: wheelsmith"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "efb0784c-3d41-478e-9010-17beb6fa5924",
                        "source_entry_id": "e865784f-85e5-3444-aa25-e809596377f2",
                        "source_sense_id": "b5c5e3f3-5ae3-3834-8a98-67131af200dc",
                        "target_lang_word": "wheelman",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "wheelman",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1f0f8f2c-f27e-3c3f-934c-ebfee15df0b4",
                                        "entry_id": "f6d19cc1-fe24-3e4d-a88f-d43175979f68",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A driver of an automobile, especially a getaway vehicle in a criminal enterprise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9adb80f2-151b-4f5c-9427-e40151431822",
                                                "sense_id": "1f0f8f2c-f27e-3c3f-934c-ebfee15df0b4",
                                                "text": "For instance, the wheelman in a robbery; he doesn't intend for anyone to get killed when he pulls up in front of a liquor store so that his armed complice can rob the store."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "20ecb130-ce42-3573-a809-83dda2af7dd9",
                                        "entry_id": "f6d19cc1-fe24-3e4d-a88f-d43175979f68",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The steersman on a ship."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3a0bab9d-3577-3668-97a2-badc3a29e14c",
                                        "entry_id": "f6d19cc1-fe24-3e4d-a88f-d43175979f68",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cyclist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e44a81cb-f94c-441e-bd76-db1b790f55aa",
                                                "sense_id": "3a0bab9d-3577-3668-97a2-badc3a29e14c",
                                                "text": "Many wheelmen and wheelwomen, riding safeties, tandems and tricycles, stopped there during the evening and we had good opportunity for comparing American and English bicycles […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b435e8f6-c180-4ddc-8f4d-13dfa4939a02",
                                                "sense_id": "3a0bab9d-3577-3668-97a2-badc3a29e14c",
                                                "text": "Old fashioned folks, for whom the horseless vehicle came to late, can but envy wheelmen and wheelwomen as they skim through vista after vista, outstripping one's horse and carriage as a greyhound outstrips a decrepit poodle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c56160f9-862c-4e0e-8819-e9bd82664a8d",
                        "source_entry_id": "e865784f-85e5-3444-aa25-e809596377f2",
